ked up today?"},{"language":"cs-CS","overview":"V Evropě roku 2041 mají všichni lidé ústavní právo prožít „jeden celý život“. Pokud se vám stane nehoda, jste oživeni a můžete pokračovat dál ve svém životě. Stačí si každé dva dny pravidelně vytvářet digitální zálohu své osobnosti – tzv. „bod obnovy“. Ale zaslouží si vůbec lidstvo právo na druhou šanci?","tagline":"Už jste se dnes zálohovali?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nTgHNb4CLv1dL9vGGVLtkc3zVPT.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i0q9Cb0L0eoHa9WdMbqlDiSH6C9.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1071815,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"cs-CS","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qxFqu8foXkq2AQTaFUIk7SwhCkd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qxFqu8foXkq2AQTaFUIk7SwhCkd.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qxFqu8foXkq2AQTaFUIk7SwhCkd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qxFqu8foXkq2AQTaFUIk7SwhCkd.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o5B720hAvPusVMhOAUjIWFHSFO4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o5B720hAvPusVMhOAUjIWFHSFO4.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2gi0XMtUvBPy45limGgJE67Wtpn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2gi0XMtUvBPy45limGgJE67Wtpn.jpg","language":"en","width":1589,"height":2384},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kivXBSm5OtFTMZKNtPyMuYvGVvr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kivXBSm5OtFTMZKNtPyMuYvGVvr.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/orig